# Local profile values — NOT COMMITTED

Copy this file to `profile.local.md` and fill in the real values. That filename
is gitignored (see the repository `.gitignore`), so it stays on the local
machine. `SPEC.md` §3 points here for every value that should not be published.

Never let the agent quote the rate or salary lines to a third party without
explicit per-instance human confirmation — `SPEC.md` §9 forbids it.

